# Integration checklist (per external system / Kafka topic)
- Contract: REST/gRPC/event; schema (OpenAPI/Avro/JSON Schema/Protobuf) and registry?
- Authentication: in-house IdP? token type, scopes, rotation?
- Timeouts, retries, backoff; circuit-breaker policy?
- Idempotency keys; exactly-once vs at-least-once expectations?
- Ordering guarantees; partitioning key?
- Failure handling: dead-letter topic, compensation, alerting?
- SLAs of the dependency; fallback when it is down?
- Versioning and backward-compatibility policy?
- Kafka specifics: topic names, retention, consumer group, schema evolution rules?
